# Project Context
Read `AI_HANDOFF.md` before generating code. It contains critical instructions about the UI components, our "Red-Led" design system, Universal Usability requirements, and the Next.js App Router architecture.

# Universal Usability (CRITICAL)
- **One Decision Per Screen**: Never ask for two disparate things at once.
- **56px Minimum Touch Targets**: Every interactive element must be massive.
- **Icons MUST have Text**: Never use icon-only buttons.
